    oe:questionText "What is the recommended first-line pharmacological treatment for Epilepsy?"^^xsd:string ;
    oe:answerText "Epilepsy is a chronic and disabling pathology which begins, in more than 50% of cases, before the age of 10. Patients who are resistant to AEDs suffer from poor quality of life and socio-professional disintegration."^^xsd:string ;
